item.description:
📹
Watch the full recording of the
International Round table "The militarization of Europe: what next?
", held on November 9, 2026, at the initiative of the
Delegation of the Russian Federation to the Vienna negotiations on military security and arms control.
🎙
Key Speakers:
00:00:00 –
I.D.Zhdanova
, Head of the Delegation of the Russian Federation to the Vienna Negotiations on Military Security and Arms Control;
00:06:27 —
S.A.Ryabkov
, Deputy Minister of Foreign Affairs of the Russian Federation;
00:27:59 — Y.V.Rusak, Head of the Division in the Department of International Military Cooperation, Ministry of Defence of the Republic of Belarus, Lieutenant Colonel;
00:34:47 — A.G.Likhonosov, Vice-Rector for International Relations and Security, Russian State Academy of Intellectual Property, Reserve Colonel;
00:49:38 —
A.N.Postigov
, Head of Division, Second CIS Department, Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Russian Federation;
01:07:33 — R.Legvold, Professor Emeritus, Department of Political Science, Columbia University, PhD (USA);
01:20:09 — D.Reinisch, Austrian political scientist, historian and independent journalist (Austria);
01:36:17 — L.M.Pacini, Associate Professor of Political Philosophy and Geopolitics, Uni Dolomiti, Belluno (Italy);
01:51:38 —
A.Yu.Mazur
, Deputy Director of the Department for Nonproliferation and Arms Control, Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Russian Federation;
🌐
02:03:17 — Free discussion (Q&A session);
02:26:47 —
A.Yu.Grozov
, Ambassador Extrao
